From 05274f1d40493c6fa032520caf7fb1e6a4b3b346 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Michael Trefry <michael@trefry.net>
Date: Wed, 12 Aug 2026 22:53:12 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] feat(quantization): add exact qmm bias epilogues

Signed-off-by: Michael Trefry <michael@trefry.net>

diff --git a/mlx/backend/cpu/quantized.cpp b/mlx/backend/cpu/quantized.cpp
